Comprehensive Study Guide: Ethical Hacking and Web Application Security

This study guide synthesizes information regarding ethical hacking methodologies, web application vulnerabilities (SQL, NoSQL, and XSS), and modern defensive strategies, including deep learning approaches and organizational risk management.


